    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"Learning to make the best out of difficult or painful experiences is a learned skill,\" writes Lilian Karanja, BScN '18, in her blog which is appropriately called \"School of Hard Knocks\". Apart from being a Critical Care nurse at the Aga Khan Hospital in Mombasa, Kenya, she is also an alumna of the Aga Khan School of Nursing and Midwifery (AKU-SONAM) and recently added \"blogger\" to her range of skills.",
